    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15541104633a515135358f8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "英雄量表达到MAX后\\n可以获得英雄技能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7947371a16c9faca684904ed751dd9cbd024069252f3810ee96a89a60af8ddcd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bccf55a52083f198ec50e885",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得了英雄技能的比赛\\n比赛结果似乎比平常更值得期待呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6991746ae269cbf40b6b58f688eebdd8f8ce002d0aff629afa2bbfb25b2fab9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d60ba8fee721999878558a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有英雄技能需通过使用比赛专用道具\\n来满足生效条件！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3138e90f7b1f416111d7dc1136c3ba8637bee843ac9c40fc047f70fa2ead280",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:427097fa1de2b7b11b4f19a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还差一点儿英雄量表就达到MAX了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f6a8e942cdd2aeaf947a9cc2bc828863b4662427f957a9e2218ad93ebfd6309",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2d3016d927850f9f40c6fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "团队成员们对参加比赛的强烈心情\\n似乎会成为一股强大力量呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a59ea99b42d9794c5aefe1fcd9a43290241e42c3e0afe0ab8fbf6b462b19055",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0db4789d9cd77ae10aa34702",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可确认有关英雄联赛的\\n各种信息！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1014ada4d9ddaac9927ed83fb559cb46ee9a53ce6f01d657bfa2d09d6fcbf719",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ed8676b7d556568ccffb950",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "达到PLATINUM1后，可获得包含满足条件的赛马娘的\\n名字的活动限定称号！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edd5e1a8b25bcc69ca861c5d15d8cfff94ef24503fda256b09ee79318bd5c46d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e72b8aef2fa78de30aac6a1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "称号「英雄奇谭」可在主要阶段的\\n排名发表后获得哦！\t",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aef985e9206a563513df8aec4df594cdc637739d7793dc013a787a3c08eb1f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79b28fff0f8e82bd6a02b17f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可确认各个赛马娘在主要阶段获得的\\n联赛得分哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15cee3402db6c7b7135a693c622f5d826366258f492444692b076173d096f200",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceafdd7380a1fc982ae2fd14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在主要阶段可使用比赛专用道具",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c317a4b343570d0550eb36595c8f4610ccf6db9b13e258d4259d6bc051f1947",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "400"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0699a600297f665bcd4f3ed8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在主要阶段举办期间可更改队伍名称",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f16df0665d45d7e1662b3423e167fecae289018da23b3ddc935aef850658ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:081eabfd1f4bda4f95589d9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "联赛得分将按各个赛马娘的名次来累加",
      "source_fingerprint": "55f894215d7ddc0c8afdfb6c2f3c842dba649679a4d631df358d9608692ccb62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "402"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8afcc1e81776dbe1732f279",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每5场比赛的天气、马场状态是随机决定的",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb4fe7b7268277085fbca72d9633a2657fb93760b74dd40084b034a924559173",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "403"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e10de60f89385880f60a01aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "确定编组需要选择3名赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb67f14fd5eb2e5e40250a25a837c489d05bcd9c51e1fa6582872db092f37102",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "404"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cb9e4b677fe4503ca43cab2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "确定编组后可获得队伍编组奖励",
      "source_fingerprint": "b34d07c96d7a731d553aaaa516cc0ebb9fffec50c02f6c98fa6ea18a170953fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30633bcd87baa3492620bc1c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特别阶段由12人参加的1场比赛来决胜服",
      "source_fingerprint": "092662bbce8ba7533704c0d6a37aa053bf70bb8dae2d26919b314453560d576b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "500"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d6f8131cc3c1ac627e853e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每场比赛的天气、马场状态是随机决定的",
      "source_fingerprint": "5445f80e014d1ccc0aef63809a65f46e5ebee5f61372ed2ddd34ea6cbc69f0a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21310ada43fba9b1b759de8b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参赛登记期间结束前可变更赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "55fcf9014b6be08db208d40870b42e7936a1206ca8cf451b1ec0964f847111cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
        "502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b952ea42ebea5632e2c1d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "特别阶段中不能使用比赛专用道具",
      "source_fingerprint": "980a94439a63ee08cc54303ff495f1bd2df4fc2b9b2104790d950221bd503c08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297",
