      "source_text": "SWBC",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ad1e76067711b1bd443f20a7cf864069d237f9e12745d7251f0e4009693a29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "299",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f542b5bbc73da79b65e08303",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各赛马娘都有不同的目标。\\n本次我们就来达成这个目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2a576d212e92bf6bfa9412e9751e327ab1e3b3fb5841111abd0574ffb80c813",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2736e25495ab324cc97693d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余体力越少，\\n失败率将会越高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f330c665e5822d536d8535659c21919faa32b1546921d43543d11246de5230fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65a38425d1756abfafe8a72c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在训练中失败的话，能力或干劲\\n将会下降，请多加注意哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9d19b275fbceef5a6ec86d152cf244e14e7e153a64d93001e6ce070e6f6a9e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95b76c288a63cd73013245d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那么，先返回一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef01803ec37bfca8b2875442edd440cad4834587f73ed9d725d9e0f19dcbf38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29e642a3f5a8b94ab4f5de50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "体力较少时，先让赛马娘\\n休息一下，回复体力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d5f7eb4ed26cd67446d76148038e612b5d8a8e8f93f2c96b0154b53a6774dc3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5e1f55d61e8190def45526b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先，请选择这里的『技能』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ad071a933bd888395de083fcba871232140856e04e8a32f013dad44f13128f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dac60221774e01f18d1bb663",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "接下来，请选择能够学习的技能。\\n将消耗刚才的技能点数！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9553e6b4ea2307e7db74ce9ff9e64961e71c17c2ef81ef367e70701b995317fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3b11eb276a6850838f6314c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次就请学习这个技能吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e5b5ae1138f80acb1e39f43125407c3c88471f379c7435bf179f0c01cd3d49f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3360978cafd79078e6c12ea9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那么，请返回吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eef01193b2f9d840931d5079bacddb178ffc70c5b4477097d1469777e1d1aed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a0ebeca12d7a28069e2b449",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这样就准备完毕了！\\n参加比赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85125680e4cfacc12078e287b27adae7248d6eeadcf336ab9e491b313980d720",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:939f6222d0a960caac798226",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有可以参加的比赛时，\\n会显示在列表里哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63224d9902b92306a9bdbbe4b37a87b784be66a5dfbc12725e79fb0d83a34e07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:482bc110916d82dd2450c344",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这些是推进育成的\\n命令选项。",
      "source_fingerprint": "656f9eace28d8286489c447f8f745b5193df93e4fad93db6e8f3196120c6184c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eff92e48096b4ec756d4f892",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次请参加这个比赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37bdd09197cde51e9ac7ded6d153359a6f204ebc151c7b08c4371245b0352963",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7f1a0b1dfd5eac96d1a0941",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在亮相圈，可以确认参赛赛马娘的\\n能力和人气等内容哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf00e05026f8665f382ed154faf0e3928efe409fd827ade10b41f264aba25f81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fd7c8b72abdcc89a8efc2e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先说明一下预测印章。印章按照『◎』\\n『○』『▲』『△』的顺序表示由高到低的评价。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37990cd6c9f6bffce23c6620f0490f8e427212ce6193e47677bdbd3d48fe4959",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e029e69ff0be55c0414c4a44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能力和干劲越高，越会受到期待，\\n赛马娘的人气也将容易变高哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2710218a8741daa92b80ba207904bce4ea99f472f31000ec8b3ed5d7e8fb418",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae76a4100621d4860513c5ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然，这并不代表比赛一定能赢，\\n但人气越高的话越能期待好的结果哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09f896aa4bb1737d56897f6fd7c9f2774d65cfe2eb63431ba6712bd497ec59f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bdf524585c675c7b7ff2fb0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "另外，在亮相圈也可以改变\\n赛马娘的作战策略哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c620e286d2b5f0a206302f131107c2dc1c3d85c904ca34f3a7fa6d5f31ee5eb7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8723c1028225e2d33c854de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "选择赛马娘擅长的\\n作战策略会比较好哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b12b1fb3ed9912220c4705f842c6887079174f7c3674051faa98511f784a209",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9431512356b04b5fb2e3c39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这样就准备完毕了！\\n终于要参赛了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "776c2ae47293e32de8ffd19a75dc90f2fd4dc9301931d0cb2403180ac3cf72bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4864be37a0e0765a0d774c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e618816c98fbf13e2056149ff0efc172ae8ed8969dbd6c7dd364cfc94ba1c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07c57732ca26b8750fa6d29b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果技能点数还有剩余的话，\\n请注意不要忘记使用哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca78c7abc734d745d6907104ad5b26cada0eb67a0067a3c63bdf20d58f805017",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "29"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b934705355e16fea3d95a72f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "执行1个命令，\\n将耗费回合数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68813f12c31e59c71e67dc816ba2140e291f81a04a8cbcad38330954b5e9cb6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2219cce198429da3dff073da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那么，育成就结束了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a6a751873a5d1712c5ac9737584c6b4b2c79750018c1821f7b2e20f8d3dc81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:653b385e2e5b9604a195fa8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成结束的赛马娘，在按一定标准得到评价后\\n将登记为『殿堂赛马娘』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc153001438f2d15dccfac12bf740f533462fed07e6bc4a35b4494c6aa3aae7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e08e73b6923f23991e6db54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请向着最高等级的评价努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c7dbdb5d79a1e84cb8d2a5f1b405d151c6053c296d0ed8194d070c4337a9a8d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19b06ec33c25113098553291",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成结束的赛马娘\\n可获得『因子』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a83af9a9cd9813e90e13ff74bb79346ff1cae5f45488cb02f3005f775b0ffb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "33"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc4c0a22d010c2eda53d96ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过将其选择为继承赛马娘，可与新赛马娘的心意相连，\\n将她的『因子』继承下去哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca29d485ac278a67e1087c43d406200a2b1bb6ac43b5dd94ff467a94e2635700",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:934ab5d8fc75ddd3bd59d6e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "恭喜获得第1名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "577d728ab25612b15b3cf10b2fe70507bd037c2f9ec4895f2d871e8d7dd648e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe1d325ecc63af830d7fbef0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请好好夸奖一下\\n努力拼搏了的赛马娘哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fb19c321f4dbdeccfe382db22659e33e25405f9727de9b1c6e4fe78eb69a0e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0db89e2ac3be054ccef9ab1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "原本比赛后会举行胜者舞台，\\n但由于本次是实习，就请允许我们省略一下哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a0d0e3faad160ed7ea17c137f6ecee143da2d4f757409b7931c4ed0ae10c872",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac368ac1a9ec1e76aed7647a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "点击这里将结束育成！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de266824b72e73be74021e536ecf4550bdc3ef64af0d7efe2ab51409b35e1a5c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4983e0e7e384cab655ea83ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "另外，虽然此次实习很短暂，\\n但原本的育成为『3年』期限。",
      "source_fingerprint": "021f0f61087df1fd705dd088af20055d141e14bfc87dca42ba70d23082eb6a85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b4956f45a103f0ebe63c7fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先试着选择『训练』命令吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7df472cb927db6ac24538b82495c2b41b3ac73d0bd311db36536db1ce290635",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab513c8d6d0e9e5fe9972ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您与赛马娘的日常，\\n请好好珍视哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4923572dc7dd9b0e1276d333e51c319bdc7c95f92c22a04d30adb1df6b12a3c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa71b1f89c54db48fc1101e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这三个印章代表了专家们的预测，\\n人气则代表粉丝们的预测。",
      "source_fingerprint": "691f68643cf126cb8dffb47f216a14872d01dc084bf3a8fe9fa667473eb11616",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7afb619850b3216202f0c120",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这些是训练的种类！\\n每一项训练提升的能力各不相同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a33c033c8b4418be3aa5832a3839d89ead799ed54f80010c5768b9faaebdb3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "5"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
